/// True when `line` looks like a function, class, or similar declaration.
///
/// Skips comments. Strips a short run of visibility and qualifiers first, including
/// Rust `pub`, `pub(crate)`, `pub(super)`, and `pub(in …)`, plus `unsafe` / `const`
/// and `extern "ABI"`. Also matches `macro_rules!` and `macro` items, Go / Swift
/// `func`, Kotlin `fun`, Swift `protocol` / `extension` / `actor`, and a Kotlin or
/// Scala `object` whose next token is `{`, `:`, or an uppercase name. Qualifiers
/// include `final`, `abstract`, `sealed`, `data`, `companion`, and `suspend`.
/// C, C++, Java, and C# lines with a return type (`void main(`, `String name(`)
/// count too. Same-line method and constructor bodies (`name() {`, `get name() {`,
/// `Foo::bar() {`, `~Widget() {`) count, including `function*` and `export default`
/// / `declare`. Named arrow bindings count (`const greet = (name) =>`,
/// `let load = async (id) =>`, `paint = x => x`). Classic function-expression
/// assignments count (`const greet = function(name) {`,
/// `let load = async function(id) {`, `var gen = function*() {`).
/// Function-like C preprocessor macros count (`#define MAX(a, b) …`);
/// object-like `#define FOO 1` stays out. Java / C# `record`, TypeScript / C#
/// `namespace` / `module`, and Rust / C `union` count. C# `partial` /
/// `readonly` / `ref` / `new` qualifiers, `delegate`, C `typedef`, and
/// Go / Java `package` count. C# `event`, Kotlin `typealias`, Dart / Kotlin
/// `mixin`, Swift `init` / `deinit` / `subscript` (plus `convenience` /
/// `required` / `fileprivate`), and C++ `operator` overloads count. Lua
/// `local function`, Perl `sub`, Nim `proc` / `method` / `iterator`, and
/// Elixir `defmodule` / `defp` / `defmacro` / `defprotocol` / `defimpl` /
/// `defstruct` / `defguard` / `defguardp` count. Pascal / Delphi / Ada
/// `procedure` and Fortran `subroutine` count. Elixir `defdelegate` /
/// `defmacrop`, Clojure `defn` / `defn-` / `defonce` / `ns`, and Haskell
/// `data` / `newtype` / `instance` (uppercase name or `(`) count. SQL
/// `CREATE TABLE` / `VIEW` / `FUNCTION` / `PROCEDURE` / `TRIGGER` / `INDEX` /
/// `SCHEMA` / `TYPE` count (optional `OR REPLACE`, temp, `IF NOT EXISTS`).
/// R bindings count (`mean <- function(x)`, `mean <<- function(x)`,
/// `read.csv <- \(file)`). `x <- 1`, `x <- functional`, and a spaced
/// `x < - function` stay out. F# / OCaml `let` / `let rec` bindings with
/// parameters (`let greet name =`, `let add = fun x ->`) count; plain
/// `let x = 1` and Rust `let f = |x| x` stay out. Parenthesized Lisp,
/// Scheme, and Clojure definitions count (`(defun greet (name)`,
/// `(defn greet [name]`, `(define (fact n)`, `(define fact (lambda (n)`,
/// `(def foo (fn [x]`, `(ns my.app`). `(def x 1)`, `(define x 1)`,
/// `(let …)`, `(defunct`, and `(definition` stay out. Scala `case class`
/// and `case object` count (`case class User(name: String)`,
/// `sealed abstract case class Expr`, `case object Empty`). Python
/// `case Point(x):`, `case 1:`, bare `case class`, and `case classes`
/// stay out. F# members count (`member this.Greet(name)`,
/// `static member Create()`, `abstract member Draw : unit -> unit`,
/// `override this.ToString()`). `member of`, `members`, and
/// `override ToString()` stay out. Kotlin `override fun` still counts as
/// `fun`. A leading Rust attribute is skipped (`#[inline] pub fn`,
/// `#[test] fn`, `#[derive(Debug)] struct`, `#[doc = "see ]"] fn`).
/// A bare `#[derive(Debug)]`, an inner `#![no_std]`, and `#` comments
/// stay out. A leading Java, Kotlin, or TypeScript `@Annotation` and a
/// leading C# or C++ `[Attribute]` are skipped the same way
/// (`@Override public void`, `@Composable fun`, `@Component class`,
/// `[Fact] public void`, `[[nodiscard]] int`). Java `@interface Name`
/// counts. A bare `@Override`, `@media`, `[section]`, and `[1, 2]` stay
/// out. A leading C++ `template<…>` header is skipped
/// (`template<typename T> void id(`, `template<> struct Foo`,
/// `export template<class T> class Box`,
/// `template<typename T> concept C`). A bare `concept C =` counts.
/// `templates`, a bare `template`, and `template<…>` with no
/// declaration stay out. Protobuf `message` / `service` / `rpc` count
/// (`message HelloRequest {`, `service Greeter {`, `rpc SayHello (`).
/// `messages`, `message the team`, and `service workers` stay out.
/// GraphQL `input` / `scalar` / `extend` / `fragment` and named
/// `query` / `mutation` / `subscription` count (`input UserInput {`,
/// `scalar DateTime`, `extend type User {`, `fragment UserFields on User {`,
/// `query GetUser {`). `input the name`, `query the logs`, `extend the buffer`,
/// and `fragment of text` stay out. Terraform / HCL blocks count
/// (`resource "aws_instance" "web" {`, `data "aws_ami" "ubuntu" {`,
/// `variable "region" {`, `output "ip" {`, `provider "aws" {`, `locals {`,
/// `terraform {`). `resource the team`, `variable names`, `output the log`,
/// `data class`, and a bare `locals` stay out (`data class` still counts as
/// a class). Objective-C instance and class methods count
/// (`- (void)viewDidLoad`, `+ (instancetype)shared`, `- (NSString *)title`,
/// `- (void)initWithFrame:(NSRect)frame`). The return type is a known C or
/// Objective-C type or an uppercase name. Markdown `- (optional) note`,
/// `- (void) more words`, and a bare `- (void)` stay out. Objective-C
/// `@implementation` / `@protocol` count (`@implementation MyClass`,
/// `@implementation MyClass (Cat)`, `@protocol MyDelegate`,
/// `@protocol MyDelegate <NSObject>`). `@interface` stays on the Java
/// annotation-type path. Bare keywords and prose stay out. Solidity
/// `contract` / `library` / `modifier` / `error` / `constructor` count
/// (`contract Token is IERC20 {`, `library Math {`, `modifier onlyOwner()`,
/// `error InsufficientBalance(uint256)`, `constructor(uint256 x)`).
/// `contract the team`, `library of tools`, `modifier of state`,
/// `error rate`, and a bare `constructor` stay out. Zig `const Name =
/// struct` / `enum` / `union` / `opaque` / `error` and `test` blocks count
/// (`const Point = struct {`, `pub const E = enum(u8) {`,
/// `const U = packed union {`, `test "add" {`, `test {`). `const x = 1`,
/// `const Foo = i32`, `test the waters`, and a bare `test` stay out.
/// MATLAB / Octave `classdef` counts (`classdef MyClass`,
/// `classdef MyClass < handle`, `classdef (Sealed) MyClass`).
/// `classdef the team`, `classdefinitions`, and a bare `classdef` stay out.
/// CMake `function(name)` / `macro(name)` / `add_executable` / `add_library` /
/// `add_custom_target` / `add_test` / `project` count (`function(my_func)`,
/// `macro(my_macro arg)`, `add_executable(app main.cpp)`,
/// `add_library(lib STATIC)`, `add_library(Foo::Bar ALIAS Foo)`,
/// `add_custom_target(docs)`, `add_test(NAME t COMMAND app)`,
/// `add_test(t app)`, `project(MyApp)`, optional space before `(`).
/// `function()`, `functions(…)`, `endfunction()`, bare keywords, and prose
/// stay out.
/// VHDL `entity` / `architecture` / `component` / `package` / `package body`
/// count (`entity Foo is`, `architecture RTL of Foo is`, `component Bar is`,
/// `package Utils is`, `package body Utils is`). `entity the team`,
/// `architecture of Foo`, `entities`, and a bare `entity` / `package` stay out.
/// Verilog / SystemVerilog `task` / `macromodule` / `program` / `primitive` /
