/// Julia `baremodule` / `primitive type` count (`baremodule Foo`,
/// `primitive type Float16 16 end`, `primitive type Float16 <: AbstractFloat 16`).
/// `baremodule the team`, `primitive type`, and a bare `baremodule` stay out.
