/// Builtin / container types only (not C `const int x =`). `struct` /
/// `enum` / `union` / `service` / `typedef` / `namespace` stay on the
/// generic prefix keys.
/// Odin `name :: proc` / `:: struct` / `:: enum` / `:: union` / `:: bit_set` /
