/// Capitalized `primitive Name` count. JS `new Foo()` / Verilog
/// `primitive udp_and (` stay out. `actor` / `class` / `trait` /
/// `interface` / `type` / `fun` stay on the generic prefix keys.
/// Cython `cdef` / `cpdef` / `ctypedef` as above.
/// Nim `converter` / `template` (`converter toBool(x: int): bool =`,
/// `template max(x, y): untyped =`, optional export `*`). C++ `template<…>`
/// stays on the template-strip path. `proc` / `method` / `iterator` /
/// `func` / `macro` stay on the generic prefix keys.
/// Standard ML `structure` / `signature` / `functor` (`structure Foo =`,
/// `structure Foo :> FOO =`, `signature FOO = sig`, `functor Make (S: ORD) =`).
/// Lean `structure Point where` stays on Lean. Smithy `structure City {`
/// stays on Smithy. `fun` / `datatype` / `module` stay on generic / other paths.
/// D `unittest` / `mixin template` / `static this` / `static ~this`
/// (`unittest {`, `unittest "add" {`, `mixin template Foo()`,
/// `static this()`, `shared static ~this()`). Prose and bare keywords stay out.
/// Nim `template` stays on Nim. `class` / `struct` / `interface` / `enum`
