/// `"stash": true`, `"verbose": true`, `"quiet": true`,
/// `"diff": "HEAD"`, plus micromatch glob task lines
/// (`"*.js": "eslint --fix"`, `"*.{js,ts}": [`, `"src/**/*.ts": "…"`).
/// Optional trailing `,` and `//` / `/*` comment. Incomplete quotes /
