/// Arrays (`processes = […]`, `handlers = […]`, `buildpacks = […]`) /
/// nested maps (`args = {…}`, `headers = {…}`) / `[env]` / free-form env
/// keys / `port = …` (MySQL option-file collision) / prose / wrong case /
